        {
          "id": 1101,
          "kind": "worked_example",
          "title": "Placeholder: Graphs, data structures and algorithms, again",
          "body": "Placeholder worked example until the review content lands.\n\nA **data structure** stores data (a list of stations). An **algorithm** is a set of steps (how to find a route). A **graph** is vertices joined by edges (stations and tracks), and a **traversal** visits every vertex it can reach."
        },
        {
          "id": 1102,
          "kind": "activity",
          "title": "Placeholder: practice on objective 1",
          "activity_id": 1101
        },
        {
          "id": 1103,
          "kind": "activity",
          "title": "Placeholder: fresh item on objective 1",
          "activity_id": 1102
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "objective_id": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": 1201,
          "kind": "worked_example",
          "title": "Placeholder: Vertices and edges, again",
          "body": "Placeholder worked example.\n\nOn a map of one-way streets, each corner is a **vertex** and each street is a **directed edge**: you can only follow it one way. A footpath is an **undirected edge**."
        },
        {
          "id": 1202,
          "kind": "activity",
          "title": "Placeholder: practice on objective 2",
          "activity_id": 1201
        },
        {
          "id": 1203,
          "kind": "activity",
          "title": "Placeholder: fresh item on objective 2",
          "activity_id": 1202
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "objective_id": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": 1301,
          "kind": "worked_example",
          "title": "Placeholder: Choosing a graph for a problem, again",
          "body": "Placeholder worked example.\n\nAsk two questions: are there things joined by connections (then it's a graph), and do the connections go one way (then it's directed)?"
        },
        {
          "id": 1302,
          "kind": "activity",
          "title": "Placeholder: practice on objective 3",
          "activity_id": 1301
        },
        {
          "id": 1303,
          "kind": "activity",
